{
  "slug": "ranger",
  "name": "Ranger",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "E2E testing and feature development tools for Claude Code",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **3 commands** and **9 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `ranger` (Ranger’s browser verification tooling that supplements a coding agent’s workflow by improving the effectiveness of a coding agent's…)\n- **Commands** (3): `disable` (Disable Ranger hooks for this session by running `ranger hook disable`), `enable` (Enable Ranger hook for this session by running `ranger hook enable`), `resume` (Resume work on a Ranger feature review by ID)\n- **Hooks** (9): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`, `SubagentStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreCompact`, `PostToolUse`, `SubagentStop`, `PermissionRequest`, and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ranger@claude-community` from `ranger-testing/trailhead` (`plugins/ranger`).",
